This is needed to disable Windows Security integration on platforms which
normally support it. This means that sh.exe and bash.exe will have less
capability than normal, but they also avoid a very expensive NetServerEnum()
call on every run.

Modifications:
  * all 'has_security' flags are set to false under `winsup\cygwin\wincap.cc`.
